      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Hermod cabalgó nueve noches por valles tan oscuros que no veía nada.",
          "en": "Hermod rode for nine nights, through valleys so dark that he could see nothing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por fin oyó un río frío y ruidoso. Se llamaba Gjoll, y lo cruzaba un puente con techo de oro.",
          "en": "At last he heard a loud, cold river. It was called Gjoll, and over it was a bridge with a golden roof."
        },
        {
          "es": "Una doncella cuidaba el puente. Se llamaba Modgud, y lo detuvo.",
          "en": "A maiden guarded the bridge. Her name was Modgud, and she stopped him."
        }
